            "review_title": "Review at O’Reka",
            "review_text": "MyHappyLand\nHouston, Texas86 contributions\n0\nGreat place for good cofffee, fresh juice and food.\nDec 2017 • Couples\nGreat place for good cofffee, fresh juice and food. \nVery simple and organic setting. Young staff full of energy. \n\nThe fresh juice is outstanding, made to order and you can take home in plastic bottles. Really, really good!\n\nFood is tasty and appealing. I had a crab dish and went back the next day for more.\n\nUnfortunately it’s a hidden place and we found it by accident. Word of mouth and trip advisor will bring lots of customers to this place over time. \n\nBest of luck to the two young partners!!\nRead more\nWritten February 2, 2018",
